OL,3,GNEWSACelebrating the studio that
OL,4,Aattracted rock royalty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey recording studio where 70s
OL,7,Fband 10cc, plus Paul McCartney and
OL,8,FCliff Richard created some of their
OL,9,Fmost iconic hits is being celebrated in
OL,10,Fa new exhibition.
OL,12,FThe dilapidated Pavilion Cinema in
OL,13,FSouth Street, Dorking, was transformed
OL,14,Finto a state-of-the-art recording
OL,15,Fstudio, named Strawberry Studios South,
OL,16,Fby 10cc in 1976.
OL,18,FThe band recorded its hit fifth album,
OL,19,FDeceptive Bends, at the site in 1977,
OL,20,Fwith the album title taking its name
OL,21,Ffrom the road sign on the nearby A24
OL,22,FMickleham bends.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
