OL,3,GNEWSACelebrating the studio that
OL,4,Aattracted rock royalty
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorking Museum curator Kathy Atherton
OL,7,Fsaid: "10cc were so proud to be making
OL,8,Fmusic outside of London."
